    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="2a10ea65-51b6-596b-9d47-545f2b81710d" activityNameId="532e713c-2599-5f8f-a271-8a6b76b729ec" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Arsine, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Arsine, at plant
The process "arsine, at plant, GLO" is modelled for the production of  arsine from sodium arsenide in the world.  Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation.  Energy consumptions and emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 007784-42-1; 
Formula: AsH3; 
Synonyms: arsane; 
UUID: 6e48ef3f-1320-3842-a4e4-c97d78ae3026
Production of arsine including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for the world.
Technology: Hydration ofsidum arsenide
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Standard values 
Extrapolations:  Energy consumptions and emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6e48ef3f-1320-3842-a4e4-c97d78ae3026.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
